{"page":432,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"426","words":[{"text":"426","x":202,"y":131,"width":76,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER06 • 링크 계층• 링크, 접속망, 랜","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER06","x":576,"y":136,"width":165,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":773,"y":142,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"링크","x":817,"y":138,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"계층•","x":879,"y":137,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"링크,","x":954,"y":138,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"접속망,","x":1030,"y":136,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"랜","x":1133,"y":136,"width":24,"height":29}]},{"text":"이 식에서 dpmp가 0에 가까우면 효올은 1에 근접한다. 그 이유는 전파 지연이 0이 되면","words":[{"text":"이","x":554,"y":263,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"식에서","x":598,"y":264,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"dpmp가","x":704,"y":263,"width":103,"height":47},{"text":"0에","x":817,"y":264,"width":51,"height":36},{"text":"가까우면","x":884,"y":263,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"효올은","x":1027,"y":262,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"1에","x":1144,"y":264,"width":48,"height":38},{"text":"근접한다.","x":1207,"y":264,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1367,"y":269,"width":35,"height":27},{"text":"이유는","x":1417,"y":264,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"전파","x":1538,"y":265,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"지연이","x":1623,"y":265,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"0이","x":1739,"y":265,"width":50,"height":38},{"text":"되면","x":1805,"y":269,"width":55,"height":40}]},{"text":"충돌한노드들이 채널을 낭비하지 않고 즉시 취소하기 때문이다. 또한d 가 아주 크","words":[{"text":"충돌한노드들이","x":551,"y":321,"width":240,"height":39},{"text":"채널을","x":809,"y":322,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"낭비하지","x":919,"y":322,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"않고","x":1066,"y":322,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"즉시","x":1146,"y":324,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"취소하기","x":1230,"y":323,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"때문이다.","x":1382,"y":324,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"또한d","x":1549,"y":326,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"가","x":1713,"y":326,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"아주","x":1760,"y":325,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"크","x":1835,"y":335,"width":27,"height":27}]},{"text":"trans","words":[{"text":"trans","x":1655,"y":350,"width":55,"height":16}]},{"text":"면 효율은 1에 근접한다. 그 이유는 프레임이 채널을 한 번 차지하면 아주 오랫동안 재","words":[{"text":"면","x":553,"y":381,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"효율은","x":595,"y":382,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"1에","x":709,"y":382,"width":46,"height":37},{"text":"근접한다.","x":770,"y":382,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":924,"y":388,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"이유는","x":970,"y":381,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"프레임이","x":1082,"y":382,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"채널을","x":1234,"y":383,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1349,"y":383,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"번","x":1399,"y":384,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"차지하면","x":1447,"y":385,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"아주","x":1605,"y":386,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"오랫동안","x":1690,"y":385,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"재","x":1836,"y":391,"width":24,"height":35}]},{"text":"널을 사용할 것이기 때문이다. 따라서 채널은 거의 모든 시간 동안 유용하게 쓰이게 된","words":[{"text":"널을","x":551,"y":441,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"사용할","x":627,"y":441,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"것이기","x":740,"y":441,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"때문이다.","x":849,"y":441,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"따라서","x":1004,"y":441,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"채널은","x":1118,"y":442,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"거의","x":1235,"y":442,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":1314,"y":444,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"시간","x":1399,"y":443,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"동안","x":1482,"y":445,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"유용하게","x":1569,"y":445,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"쓰이게","x":1725,"y":445,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"된","x":1835,"y":450,"width":25,"height":36}]},{"text":"다.","words":[{"text":"다.","x":549,"y":501,"width":40,"height":37}]},{"text":"6.33 순번 프로토콜","words":[{"text":"6.33","x":548,"y":611,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"순번","x":710,"y":609,"width":82,"height":44},{"text":"프로토콜","x":803,"y":612,"width":165,"height":41}]},{"text":"다중 접속 프로토콜에서 요구되는 두 가지 특성으로는 (1) 단 하나의 노드만이 활성이","words":[{"text":"다중","x":547,"y":709,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"접속","x":628,"y":709,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜에서","x":704,"y":709,"width":196,"height":38},{"text":"요구되는","x":917,"y":710,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1064,"y":712,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":1112,"y":710,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"특성으로는","x":1193,"y":711,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"(1)","x":1380,"y":715,"width":46,"height":35},{"text":"단","x":1442,"y":712,"width":37,"height":36},{"text":"하나의","x":1493,"y":713,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"노드만이","x":1615,"y":715,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"활성이","x":1772,"y":715,"width":88,"height":41}]},{"text":"면 그 노드가 R bps의 처리율을 가지며, (2) M개의 노드가 활성이면 각 노드가 거의","words":[{"text":"면","x":548,"y":769,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":593,"y":775,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"노드가","x":641,"y":769,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"R","x":755,"y":775,"width":24,"height":28},{"text":"bps의","x":791,"y":770,"width":83,"height":41},{"text":"처리율을","x":895,"y":770,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"가지며,","x":1044,"y":771,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"(2)","x":1169,"y":775,"width":43,"height":35},{"text":"M개의","x":1229,"y":771,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"노드가","x":1347,"y":773,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"활성이면","x":1472,"y":773,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"각","x":1635,"y":775,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"노드가","x":1686,"y":775,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"거의","x":1807,"y":777,"width":53,"height":39}]},{"text":"R/M bps의 처리율을 가진다는 것이다. 알로하와 CSMA 프로토콜은 첫 번째 특성은","words":[{"text":"R/M","x":544,"y":834,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"bps의","x":622,"y":830,"width":84,"height":42},{"text":"처리율을","x":726,"y":830,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"가진다는","x":874,"y":831,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1025,"y":832,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"알로하와","x":1151,"y":832,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"CSMA","x":1302,"y":836,"width":113,"height":30},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":1435,"y":836,"width":181,"height":36},{"text":"첫","x":1635,"y":835,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"번째","x":1687,"y":836,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"특성은","x":1772,"y":837,"width":91,"height":38}]},{"text":"지니고 있으나 두 번째 특성은 없다. 이것이 다른 종류의 프로토콜, 즉 순번 프로토콜","words":[{"text":"지니고","x":546,"y":890,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"있으나","x":661,"y":891,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":772,"y":893,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"번째","x":822,"y":892,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"특성은","x":901,"y":891,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"없다.","x":1019,"y":893,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"이것이","x":1109,"y":893,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1225,"y":893,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"종류의","x":1307,"y":894,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜,","x":1428,"y":897,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"즉","x":1598,"y":898,"width":37,"height":35},{"text":"순번","x":1650,"y":896,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜","x":1737,"y":900,"width":125,"height":36}]},{"text":"(taking-turns protocol)을 개발하게 된 동기다. 랜덤 접속 프로토콜처럼 순번 프로토","words":[{"text":"(taking-turns","x":544,"y":956,"width":216,"height":38},{"text":"protocol)을","x":771,"y":953,"width":183,"height":40},{"text":"개발하게","x":968,"y":953,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"된","x":1115,"y":953,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"동기다.","x":1161,"y":955,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"랜덤","x":1289,"y":954,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"접속","x":1373,"y":955,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜처럼","x":1456,"y":956,"width":213,"height":37},{"text":"순번","x":1687,"y":956,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"프로토","x":1771,"y":960,"width":91,"height":31}]},{"text":"콜도 수십 개가 있으며, 이 프로토콜들 각각에 대해 다양한 변형이 존재한다. 여기서는","words":[{"text":"콜도","x":543,"y":1015,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"수십","x":622,"y":1014,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"개가","x":704,"y":1013,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"있으며,","x":784,"y":1013,"